{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>El</b> — The prophet warns the people of that generation. Yefet said: \"El\" means do not trust in the great one. In my opinion: since he speaks to women, [it means] do not trust in the companion of your youth, for he warns the companion against the one who lies in your bosom."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:13.278776892Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}